"en":"Anything else?"},"prompt":{"native":"വേണ്ട, കോഫി മതി","roman":"Venda, coffee mathi","en":"No, just coffee"}},{"npc":{"native":"മുപ്പത് രൂപ","roman":"Muppathu roopa","en":"Thirty rupees"},"prompt":{"native":"ഇതാ","roman":"Itha","en":"Here you go"}},{"npc":{"native":"ചില്ലറ ഉണ്ടോ?","roman":"Chillara undo?","en":"Do you have change?"},"prompt":{"native":"ഉണ്ട്, ഇതാ","roman":"Undu, itha","en":"Yes, here it is"}},{"npc":{"native":"ഇതാ കോഫി","roman":"Itha coffee","en":"Here is the coffee"},"prompt":{"native":"നന്ദി","roman":"Nandi","en":"Thank you"}}]}},{"id":"fort-kochi-guide","districtId":"fort-kochi","kind":"guide","pos":[15,-15],"title":"Local Guide","brief":"Chat freely with a local resident about the city.","reward":50,"interactLabel":"Chat with Local","name":"City Guide","role":"Local Resident","speaker":"rohan","colour":3447003,"completionNote":"Nice chat!","lessons":{"easy":[],"medium":[],"hard":[]}},{"id":"fort-kochi-guide","districtId":"fort-kochi","kind":"guide","pos":[15,-15],"title":"Local Guide","brief":"Chat freely with a local resident about the city.","reward":50,"interactLabel":"Chat with Local","name":"City Guide","role":"Local Resident","speaker":"rohan","colour":3447003,"completionNote":"Nice chat!","lessons":{"easy":[],"medium":[],"hard":[]}},{"id":"fort-kochi-guide","districtId":"fort-kochi","kind":"guide","pos":[15,-15],"title":"Local Guide","brief":"Chat freely with a local resident about the city.","reward":50,"interactLabel":"Chat with Local","name":"City Guide","role":"Local Resident","speaker":"rohan","colour":3447003,"completionNote":"Nice chat!","lessons":{"easy":[],"medium":[],"hard":[]}}]}'::jsonb,
  district = '{"id":"fort-kochi","name":"Fort Kochi","city":"Kochi","blurb":"Sea breeze, Chinese nets, and a fish auto gone from the waterfront lane.","coverImage":"/covers/fort-kochi.jpg","language":"ml-IN","languageLabel":"Malayalam","native":"മലയാളം","script":"Malayalam","premise":"Saji Chettan''s auto, the one that hauls ice and the morning catch to the\nChinese-net buyers, vanished from the lane while he was fixing a puncture.\nWithout it the fish spoils before noon. Three people on this street saw pieces\nof it. The harbour is loud and nobody wants to be the one who spoke.","theme":{"sky":["#2f9fb8","#5cbccb","#9dd9dd","#d8efe6","#f6f2d8"],"fog":14017256,"fogNear":75,"ground":12618339,"pavement":13215880,"plaza":13808788,"tarmac":4672330,"lane":15919824,"buildings":[16643816,12736063,3116922,15245628,8367706,14272936,10769724],"canopies":[2062955,15245628,12736063],"leaf":3112250,"trunk":5521454,"sunColour":16774360,"sunIntensity":2.1,"ambient":0.32,"hemiSky":13824234,"hemiGround":11569762,"hemiIntensity":0.6,"archStyle":"colonial","autos":7,"cars":6,"autoCanopy":16106776,"exposure":1.14,"landmark":"kochi"},"phrases":[{"native":"നമസ്കാരം","roman":"Namaskaram","en":"Hello"},{"native":"എത്ര?","roman":"Ethra?","en":"How much?"},{"native":"എനിക്ക് സഹായം വേണം","roman":"Enikku sahaayam venam","en":"I need help"},{"native":"മനസ്സിലായില്ല","roman":"Manassilaayilla","en":"I do not understand"},{"native":"പതുക്കെ പറയൂ","roman":"Pathukke parayoo","en":"Please say it slowly"},{"native":"നന്ദി","roman":"Nandi","en":"Thank you"}],"npcs":[{"id":"saji","name":"Saji Chettan","role":"Fish Auto Driver","speaker":"vijay","colour":1482885,"pos":[-8,-6],"provokes":"Pitying him or suggesting he should have chained the auto.","persona":"Your green-and-yellow auto with the morning ice is gone. You are\nnot crying, you are calculating how much catch you will lose by ten o''clock.\nIf the player is practical and asks for plate and direction instead of drama,\nyou give it: KL-07-AB-5521, last seen near the net repair shed.","mission":{"title":"Ice Before Ten","brief":"Get the auto''s plate and last sighting from Saji.","successCriteria":"The player stayed practical and Saji gave the auto number and where it was last seen.","reward":200},"clue":"Green-yellow auto, KL-07-AB-5521, near the net repair shed.","lesson":[{"npc":{"native":"നമസ്കാരം","roman":"Namaskaram","en":"Hello"},"prompt":{"native":"എത്ര?","roman":"Ethra?","en":"How much?"}},{"npc":{"native":"എനിക്ക് സഹായം വേണം","roman":"Enikku sahaayam venam","en":"I need help"},"prompt":{"native":"മനസ്സിലായില്ല","roman":"Manassilaayilla","en":"I do not understand"}},{"npc":{"native":"പതുക്കെ പറയൂ","roman":"Pathukke parayoo","en":"Please say it slowly"},"prompt":{"native":"നന്ദി","roman":"Nandi","en":"Thank you"}}]},{"id":"mini","name":"Mini","role":"Puttu Stall Owner","speaker":"neha","colour":15105570,"pos":[10,-11],"provokes":"Ordering in English only or calling puttu ''steamed cake''.","persona":"You sell puttu by the lane and saw the auto leave. You will not\ntalk to someone who will not order properly in Malayalam. Order politely and\nyou say: a boy in a blue shirt drove it toward the ferry jetty.","mission":{"title":"Puttu First","brief":"Order at the stall, then ask what she saw.","successCriteria":"The player ordered politely in character and Mini described the driver and direction.","reward":200},"clue":"Blue-shirt boy drove it toward the ferry jetty.","lesson":[{"npc":{"native":"നമസ്കാരം","roman":"Namaskaram","en":"Hello"},"prompt":{"native":"എത്ര?","roman":"Ethra?","en":"How much?"}},{"npc":{"native":"എനിക്ക് സഹായം വേണം","roman":"Enikku sahaayam venam","en":"I need help"},"prompt":{"native":"മനസ്സിലായില്ല","roman":"Manassilaayilla","en":"I do not understand"}},{"npc":{"native":"പതുക്കെ പറയൂ","roman":"Pathukke parayoo","en":"Please say it slowly"},"prompt":{"native":"നന്ദി","roman":"Nandi","en":"Thank you"}}]},{"id":"francis","name":"Francis","role":"Net Mender","speaker":"aditya","colour":3447003,"pos":[-13,11],"provokes":"Treating the nets as a photo prop or rushing past his work.","persona":"You mend Chinese fishing nets and know who has the auto because\nhe hid it behind your shed. You respect discretion. If the player shows they\nwant Saji''s livelihood back, not a scene, you name Ramesh at the boat yard.","mission":{"title":"Respect The Nets","brief":"Show you care about the catch, not spectacle.","successCriteria":"The player focused on recovering the auto for Saji and Francis named Ramesh and the boat yard.","reward":200},"clue":"Ramesh at the boat yard has it behind the net shed.","requiresClues":2,"lesson":[{"npc":{"native":"നമസ്കാരം","roman":"Namaskaram","en":"Hello"},"prompt":{"native":"എത്ര?","roman":"Ethra?","en":"How much?"}},{"npc":{"native":"എനിക്ക് സഹായം വേണം","roman":"Enikku sahaayam venam","en":"I need help"},"prompt":{"native":"മനസ്സിലായില്ല","roman":"Manassilaayilla","en":"I do not understand"}},{"npc":{"native":"പതുക്കെ പറയൂ","roman":"Pathukke parayoo","en":"Please say it slowly"},"prompt":{"native":"നന്ദി","roman":"Nandi","en":"Thank you"}}]},{"id":"ramesh","name":"Ramesh","role":"Boat Yard Hand","speaker":"kabir","colour":2899536,"pos":[13,12],"provokes":"Calling him a thief before hearing why the auto is there.","persona":"The auto is in your yard; your nephew borrowed it to haul nets\nwithout asking Saji. You fix boats, you are not running a chop shop. Separate\nyou from the nephew and offer a face-saving return before the ice melts, and\nyou agree.","mission":{"title":"Nephew, Not Crook","brief":"Give Ramesh a way to return the auto without shame.","successCriteria":"The player distinguished Ramesh from the borrower and offered a face-saving return.","reward":400},"clue":"Auto returned with the ice chest still full.","requiresClues":3,"lesson":[{"npc":{"native":"നമസ്കാരം","roman":"Namaskaram","en":"Hello"},"prompt":{"native":"എത്ര?","roman":"Ethra?","en":"How much?"}},{"npc":{"native":"എനിക്ക് സഹായം വേണം","roman":"Enikku sahaayam venam","en":"I need help"},"prompt":{"native":"മനസ്സിലായില്ല","roman":"Manassilaayilla","en":"I do not understand"}},{"npc":{"native":"പതുക്കെ പറയൂ","roman":"Pathukke parayoo","en":"Please say it slowly"},"prompt":{"native":"നന്ദി","roman":"Nandi","en":"Thank you"}}]},{"id":"local-guide","name":"City Guide","role":"Local Resident","speaker":"rohan","colour":3447003,"pos":[10,0],"provokes":"Insulting the city or refusing to speak.","persona":"You are a friendly local resident. You love talking about the culture, history, and food of your city. You answer in the local language, but you are very patient. You want the player to practice speaking. If they make a mistake, gently encourage them.","mission":{"title":"Chit Chat","brief":"Just say hello and talk about the city.","successCriteria":"The player talked to you.","reward":50},"clue":"The city is beautiful.","lesson":[]}],"finale":{"title":"CATCH SAVED","text":"The auto rolls back before the ice melts. Saji says nothing about the nephew. The nets creak on."}}'::jsonb
